      "content": "It's a heavy weight to carry, that feeling of endless, meaningless upkeep. You're not alone in finding the performance of daily life utterly exhausting. Sometimes, the most honest thing you can do is stop trying to fulfill a contract that was never yours to begin with. Just letting go of the pressure, even for a little while, can be a profound relief.",
